# Python-generated files
**/__pycache__/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
*.py[oc]
build/
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info

# Virtual environments
.venv

# Secrets — never commit
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OS specific
**/.DS_Store

# Untracked sources
**/docs/landing-zone

# Ingested tool pages under the CLI guidance tree — authored install.md and
# quick_start.md alongside them stay tracked
**/workstation/cli/*/reference.md

# Same rule for the MCP guidance tree — the authored setup.md stays tracked
**/workstation/mcp/*/reference.md

# Temp files
**/.clearance*

# Per-clone skill links. Claude Code and Copilot both discover .claude/skills/,
# but the links there are symlinks on macOS and junctions on Windows, so the
# link itself cannot be tracked. skills/README.md carries the command.
.claude/

# Per-clone Claude Code route to AGENTS.md, one line: `@AGENTS.md`. Untracked
# because Copilot CLI reads AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md both, so a tracked import
# loads the instructions twice in every Copilot clone. Written by
# `link_config.py --claude-md --apply`.
/CLAUDE.md

# Generated by workstation scripts with --persist
/workstation-status-*
/status-*.md
/status-*.csv
/status-*.json
/inventory-*.md
/inventory-*.csv
/inventory-*.json
/link-config-*.md
/link-config-*.csv
/link-config-*.json

# IDEs
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.zed/